{"kind": "mod", "id": 492, "name": "Lots of Loot", "slug": "lots-of-loot", "teaser": "Allows Items to spawn inside loose containers (eg. Docs Case in marked room)\r\nMultiple pieces of Loot can spawn in the same spot", "owner_name": "RainbowPC", "downloads": 80285, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:36.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-06-29T22:03:21.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-06-29T22:03:21.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.8.0", "latest_version": "2.2.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>New versions of this mod can be found at <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2212-lots-of-loot-redux/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lots of Loot Redux</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Combined LooseLootOverlay and LootInLooseContainers</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Now adds Keys/Valuables to the “Rusted Bloody Key” Room</strong></p>\n<p>In patch 12.12 the ability for Items to spawn in loose containers was removed. This mod brings this back and also allows items to spawn in loose Backpacks.</p>\n<p>Also removed was that multiple pieces of loot can spawn in the same spot.</p>\n<p>Includes config to change the spawnrate of specific items and spawnpoints.</p>\n<p>Also adjusts some Prices of some items to be closer to live (eg Red Card costing 50mil instead of 800k)</p>\n<p>All price changes can be adjusted in the config</p>\n<p>Each part of the mod can be disabled individually</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 13013, "published_at": "2023-11-20T15:10:13.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/492/lots-of-loot/2.1.1", "githu